# Text files are stored with LF in the repository (already true for every
# tracked text file). Checkout conversion follows each clone's Git
# configuration: the owner's Windows laptop and the CI workflow both use
# core.autocrlf=true, so working copies contain CRLF. See docs/ci.md.
* text=auto

# Binary assets are never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.glb binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.blend binary
